# Vercel turns every .js file under api/ into its own Serverless Function
# (Hobby plan caps at 12). Only api/index.js should be one — runtime code lives
# in api/_lib and api/_routes, which Vercel skips because the path contains "/_".
# These are dev-only and never required at runtime, so they are excluded from
# the deployment entirely.
api/scripts
api/index.legacy.js
api/API_INDEX.md
